  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "knock back and damage enemies in a straight line",
    "skill1": "deal heavy single-target damage",
    "skill2": "bless one ally, dealing bonus damage to enemies hit by their normal attacks",
    "skill3": "haste grows while first blessed ally remains alive",
    "skill4": "ultimate path blesses all hit allies temporarily",
    "skill5": "ultimate reduces enemies' Magic DEF for a while"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Cassadee]] blesses one ally so their attacks deal bonus Magic damage to struck enemies, keeping her Haste high while that ally lives. Her heavy single-target strike adds direct pressure, and her ultimate knocks back foes in a line while temporarily blessing allies it touches. The ultimate path also lowers enemy Magic DEF after impact. She blends damage, soft control, and ally amplification in one slot. She falters when the blessed ally dies early, enemies dodge the line, or no partner attacks often enough to sustain the blessing.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Cassadee]] blesses one ally so hits add bonus Magic damage and ramp her Haste while that unit lives, then fires a knockback line that shreds Magic DEF. Kill or delay the blessed carry before the amplification snowballs with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]], or delete it with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]]. If the partner survives, pressure [[Cassadee]] herself with the same rear tools. Dodge the predictable ultimate line so its debuff and temporary blessing miss."
}
